[{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"我决定听取小雨的意见，出门吹吹晚风。","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"但也并不是漫无目的地去散步。","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「——喝」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"我一边朝正前方挥舞竹刀，一边把左脚往后收。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"竹刀稳稳停住后，我再次将其高高举起，并让收回的左脚往后退一步。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「——喝」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"而后在再次挥下竹刀的同时，右脚也退后一步。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"虽然我正在像这样练习着正面素振，但脑子里却一直在想事情。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「回去……不回去……回去……不回去」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"每当竹刀挥下，我都会将自己的迷茫诉诸于口。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"然而这并不是掰花瓣，再怎么念叨也得不出一个明确的结果。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"这么一想，我手臂的动作也自然而然地慢了下来。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……呼……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"其实根本不用在这种事情上烦恼。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「到头来，还是取决于我真正的想法」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"如果想要回到舒适的大城市，那直接回去就是了。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"反正也不是再也回不来这里。我的外公，以及廉太郎他们都在这。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"只要愿意，我随时都能回来。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"反过来，如果我想继续在这里住一阵子的话，那么也只要把这种想法说出来就可以了。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"我可以住在旅馆，也可以借住廉太郎家。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"他们……应该不会拒绝吧。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"所以说，只要我能得出答案就可以了……","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我会如此烦恼……也就是说我想留在这里吧？」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"为什么我心里感觉这么不痛快呢？","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"心里似乎有一个疙瘩，让我非常不舒服……","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「或许这就是我无法下定决心留在这里的最大理由……？」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「能明白这件事，就说明这竹刀没白挥」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"而且也让我好好锻炼了一番。那么，也该回房间了。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……哎，里面的房间还亮着灯啊」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"看来我刚才注意力太过集中，以至于连这种事情都没察觉到。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「有谁在那里吗？」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"我进去之后，看到了一个意外的身影。","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"朝武正表情严肃地跳神乐舞。","art":{"background":"a1426","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"虽然已经看过很多次她献舞的模样了，但我还是第一次在这种时间看到。","art":{"background":"a1426","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"她一般在天黑前就会献完舞。","art":{"background":"a1426","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"她以前之所以不弄得那么晚，恐怕是为了留出晚上祓禊的时间。","art":{"background":"a1426","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a1426","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"朝武好像没发现我，依旧在英姿飒爽地跳着神乐舞。","art":{"background":"a1426","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"她做事还是这么专注。","art":{"background":"a1426","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"她的身体已经牢牢记住了舞蹈的动作，并且丝毫不差。","art":{"background":"a1426","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"和我那每个动作都需要反复确认的素振截然不同。","art":{"background":"a1426","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"她美丽的身影吸引了我的视线……不，更应该说是看入了迷。","art":{"background":"a1426","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「（……我这已经是第几次看入迷了？）」","art":{"background":"a1426","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「（她跳的神乐舞我已经看过不知多少次了，但现在依旧让我如此着迷）」","art":{"background":"a1426","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「（……）」","art":{"background":"a1426","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"我站在一旁，静静地欣赏朝武的舞，直到她跳完为止。","art":{"background":"a1426","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……呼……」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1427","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「辛苦了，朝武」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1427","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「哎，啊，有地，你这是在做什么？还拿着竹刀……」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a180","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「难道发现了可疑分子？」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1428","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不是的不是的，我只不过是借用了下神社的空地练习素振」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1428","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「练习素振本身倒是没问题……可是在这时间练习的话，搞不好你自己会被当成可疑分子的」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1135","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……说得倒也没错」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1135","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「不过，我想晚上也基本上不会有人来参拜……」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1429","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我倒是很好奇，你为什么在这个时间献舞？」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1429","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「这是因为……爸爸和茉子劝我今天休息休息」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1430","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「我听从了他们的建议……可就是坐立不安」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1135","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"从这番话里就可以听出，她日复一日坚持献舞的时间有多长。","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1135","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"我做的这些锻炼还远远没有铭刻到自己的身体里。","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1135","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"如果不是今天抱有烦恼，我肯定高高兴兴地去休息了。","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1135","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「既然一直在房间里呆着也不痛快……那还不如按习惯过来献舞，反倒能让心情更加舒畅」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1135","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「因为已经很晚了，我一开始也在犹豫……不过最后还是这么做了」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1431","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「而且……」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1432","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"朝武忽然看向才供奉不久的宿体。","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1432","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「一切居然这样就结束了，感觉一点都不真实，所以不由自主地想过来看看……」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1135","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……是吗」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1135","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「为了解除诅咒做了那么多努力，但是真解除了，竟然不知所措起来……」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1137","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「这样感觉真奇怪」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1433","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我也有同感」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1433","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「虽然还不能确定诅咒是不是完全解除了」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1431","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「可我整个人都已经松懈下来了啊……」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1137","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这没办法。不过至少这件事算是告一段落了」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1137","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「而且，似乎小雨也不觉得还会有多大问题，真的只是“以防万一”而已」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1137","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……有地」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1434","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「嗯？怎么了」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1434","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「宿体的事情……那个……真是谢谢你了，你帮了太多的忙」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1434","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「而且我还对你说过很多失礼的话，对此我也非常抱歉」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1133","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这没办法，毕竟事出有因」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1133","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「可是，这次如果没有你在——」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1428","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「停，别说了」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1428","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"我竖着伸出手掌，打断了朝武的话语。","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1428","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这不只是我的功劳。没了常陆也是不行的」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a180","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「而且还有小雨、蕾娜、我外公、安晴叔叔、驹川大夫」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a180","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「缺少了任何一个人，都不会有现在的结果」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a180","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「当然，我也很感激其他那些人」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1435","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「而且，你也同样厥功至伟」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1435","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「哎？我哪里有功劳了，倒不如说我就是这场风波的中心……」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1135","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「总之我肯定没资格接受感谢」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1430","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「唔……」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1430","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"这时我说谢谢，就相当于谢她受到了诅咒。","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1430","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"那么……我该说些什么呢？我思来想去，也不知道说什么好。","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1430","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"话说回来——","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1430","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……你真的好认真啊」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1430","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"当然了，这也是朝武的优点。","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a180","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"但是我并不是因为顾虑她的心情才谢她的。","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a180","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「偶尔一两次装作没听见也可以嘛」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a180","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「这种态度对对方很失礼的」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a176","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「没错，始终是这种态度的话的确有问题」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a176","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「可是你就从来没有想轻轻松松聊个天的时候？不想发点鸡毛蒜皮的牢骚？」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a176","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a181","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「如果有什么心事，不介意的话跟我说说吧」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a181","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「为什么你会觉得我有心事？」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1436","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这个嘛，跟你聊了几句后，就发现你和平常有些不一样」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1436","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……唔……感觉……自己被你完全看穿了一样，好不甘心」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1437","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「啊哈哈，你这话说得」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1437","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「总而言之，不管是牢骚还是什么，我都愿意听你说说」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1437","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「有地……」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1438","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「所以你现在是在说客气话，我应该假装没听见？」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1439","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我不是说现在！」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1439","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「啊哈哈，开玩笑的。我太不甘心了，就稍微报复了一下」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1440","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1440","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"没想到朝武竟然开起了玩笑……","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1441","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"她说自己不知所措，但其实现在很高兴才对吧？","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1441","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"刚才的笑容也和平常不一样。","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1441","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"虽说她平常威风凛凛的样子也很棒……但是这种纯朴的模样也很可爱。","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1441","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「不过，倒也是。那……能拜托你吗？」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1442","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「没问题，只要我能帮得上忙就行」","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1442","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"看到她显露出比往常更有魅力的表情，我不由得屏住了呼吸。","art":{"background":"a120","sprites":[{"asset":"a1442","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"我们两人坐在神社里的台阶上。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"……虽说是顺势变成了这样，但毫无疑问我现在正在和女孩子独处。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"而且是在周遭寂寂无人的深夜。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"我有点心跳加速……变得紧张起来。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「那么，有什么牢骚呢？」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"祟神一事已经告一段落，按理说她应该迎来了平静的生活才对。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「准确地说，并不是牢骚……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1429","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「就像刚才所说的，诅咒的事情就这样解决了，而我的心境却没有调整过来，感觉一切都那么不真实」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1137","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「嗯」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1137","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"多年来……不，几百年来，她们一族都饱受诅咒的折磨。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1429","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"想必朝武她从小就被诅咒束缚着。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1429","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"单凭一句「已经获得了解脱」，也不会有什么切实的感受。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1429","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「再过一段时间，自然而然就能接受了吧」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1429","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「虽然我也是这么想的……但是……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a191","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「茉子和我爸爸他们如此兴高采烈，那才是让困扰我的真正原因」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1430","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1430","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「啊！你不要理解错了，我自己也很开心」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1135","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「只不过……似乎我周围的人比我还要激动……所以说，那个……该怎么说才好呢……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1137","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「觉得自己和周围格格不入？」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1137","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「对！就是这个意思！结果这让我更加不知所措」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1431","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「而且，如果能更早知晓碎片的真相的话，说不定我妈妈也不会……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1443","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1443","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「我也知道，再怎么去想这些事情也于事无补。但我心里就是有这些疙瘩，让我不能真正高兴起来……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1135","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「所以说，那个……对不起，跟你说了这么多根本得不出结论的话」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1431","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「可是如果和茉子或者我爸爸说这些……会给他们带来不必要的不安」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1135","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这倒是」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1135","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"也就是说，正因为她认识我的时间短，才能将这些牢骚说出口。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1135","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「也正因为这样，让我的心结越来越大」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1137","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"和周围格格不入啊……","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1137","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我想想……唔……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1137","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「朝武，你有什么想做的事情吗？」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1137","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「想做的事情？」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a181","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「比如去大城市购物」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a181","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「镇里卖的东西已经够用了」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1444","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这只是举个例子，也可以不是购物」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1444","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「就算是很小的事情也行，只要让你对今后能有所期待，说不定就能消除现在的这种格格不入感」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1444","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「安晴叔叔和常陆也应该很希望看到你从诅咒中解脱，获得自由」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1444","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「但是我没法调整好自己的心情，根本无心考虑今后的事情」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1137","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我猜正因为这样，你才会产生那种被别人丢下的感觉吧？」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1137","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「你这么一说，好像是被你说中了一点」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a175","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「想做的事情……想做的事情吗……不知道从什么时候开始，解除诅咒就成为了我人生中最重要的事情」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1135","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「是吗……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1135","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「总之呢，先给自己留点时间好好思考吧」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1135","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……你说得对」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1135","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"朝武忽然间抬头仰望夜空。","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"她不像是在思索，似乎是在畅想未来。","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「可以笼统一些，只是一些小事也可以」","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「总而言之，你只要去尝试做你想做的事情就可以了」","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「今天你先去休息吧，像这种时候，泡澡是解除疲劳的最佳手段」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1445","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「那能不能告诉我你想做的事情呢，让我参考一下」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1446","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我？」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1446","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「肯定有很多想做的吧」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1440","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「比如因为失去了必须留在穗织的理由，所以期待着回到大城市之类的」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1417","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这个……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1417","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"我就是因为在苦恼这些事情才来这边挥竹刀的。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"该怎么回答她呢……","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「既然都转校过来了，我还是想在这里待到毕业」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"……","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"咦？我脑子里明明一直在烦恼……嘴巴却自然而然地说出了答案。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「转学来转学去的也麻烦」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1445","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「而且我挺喜欢现在的生活的」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1445","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「是吗……太好了，这可让我放心不少」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1433","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「哎？为什么会放心……？」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1433","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「你要是不在了，我会寂寞的。因为你是我——」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1447","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……我是你？」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1447","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「——交到的第一个朋友」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1440","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"我就知道会是这样。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1441","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"但是看着露出温柔笑容的朝武……我也不由得笑了。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1441","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"最主要的是让我松了口气。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1441","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"她露出了这种表情，就代表她接纳了我，允许我留在这里。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1441","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「说我是你的第一个朋友，虽然我很开心，但是常陆会伤心的吧」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1441","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「我也没有轻视茉子。只不过我从小就和她在一起了」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1138","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「她对我来说与其说是朋友……更应该说是关系更亲密的人……跟个爱操心的妹妹差不多吧」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1417","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……不是爱操心的姐姐？」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1417","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「你这是什么意思？难道你想说我才像个小孩子？」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1448","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「唔……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1448","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"说实话，我真是这么想的。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1448","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"但要是把这话说出口，肯定会惹她生气。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1448","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「是啊，因为你们从小就一起，所以就像是一对姐妹」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1448","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「你这是想糊弄过去吧？是想岔开话题吧？」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a184","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「你想多了」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a184","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……盯……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1448","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1448","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「算了，不多说了」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1449","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「总之，这是我第一次和男生关系这么好。你是我重要的朋友」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1417","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「我不管怎么跟你道谢都不足够。你帮了我太多太多」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1440","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「如果丛雨丸选的不是你……我现在应该根本不会想到这些」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1135","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1135","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「噗，哈哈」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1135","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「为、为什么要笑？我说了什么奇怪的话吗？」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a195","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不是的，抱歉。看你说得这么夸张，我就没忍住」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a195","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我不过是走一步算一步，一路挣扎了过来罢了」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a195","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「能有现在的结果，纯粹是偶然。我根本没多大功劳，你说得太夸张了」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a195","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「就算是这样……我也真的很感谢你」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1418","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「啊，对不起，我不应该笑出来的。我绝对没有笑话你的意思」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1418","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我只是觉得，我没有你说的那么了不起」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1418","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a201","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「而且要我说的话，这是你努力过的证明。因为你一直没有气馁，才有了现在的结果」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a201","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「说不定，我在这里拔出丛雨丸是件命中注定的事情」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a201","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「但是呢，或许正是因为你一直以来的努力，才让我有了这个机会。所以说……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a201","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「——噢，对了，直接这样说就好了嘛」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a201","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「朝武，你努力了这么多年，辛苦你了」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1445","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a181","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a181","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"听到我这番话，朝武凝固在了原地。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a181","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"好像……她不怎么高兴啊。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a181","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「啊……抱歉，果然这种话不适合我」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a181","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「呃？啊，不是的，那个……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a191","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我算是哪根葱啊，还一副高高在上的样子……我真的不是那个意思」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a191","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「不、不是的。我不是不高兴……只不过……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a198","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「只不过我没想到会听到你对我说这种话……所以有些不知该怎么回答怎么应对，或者说该作何反应」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1450","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「总、总而言之……谢谢你……？」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1451","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「又是疑问句啊」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1451","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「因、因为……要知道……啊呜……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1452","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不用那么为难自己啦」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1452","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「要是做出了奇怪的回答，就太对不起你了。你明明是在体谅我的心情……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a198","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我这么说并不是在体谅你，这些都是真心话」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a198","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「那我告诉你，我说的也同样是真心话」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1418","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「嗯，谢谢。能听到你这么说，我也很开心」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1418","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1453","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……你不明白……你根本不明白……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a176","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「朝武？」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a176","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「有地，你真没礼貌」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a178","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「怎么回事？我不过是正常地道个谢而已……」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a178","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……算了。总之非常感谢你今天能听我说这么多，现在我心情好点了」","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[{"asset":"a1417","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"说完这话，朝武就迈出了步子。","art":{"background":"a1425","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……呼……真舒服……」","art":{"background":"a1454","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"运动之后泡的澡就是舒服。","art":{"background":"a1454","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"当然，肯定也是因为没了祟神这个莫名的不安因素。","art":{"background":"a1454","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「我想做的事情……」","art":{"background":"a1455","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"我也不是没考虑过。","art":{"background":"a1455","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"但是从没有考虑得太具体过。","art":{"background":"a1455","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「想做的事情啊……」","art":{"background":"a1456","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"小时候的我是有想做的事情的。","art":{"background":"a1456","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"有很多话想传达给妈妈。","art":{"background":"a1456","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"而现在，妈妈已经不在了……再怎么后悔，一切都已经于事无补。","art":{"background":"a1456","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"我现在想做的事情……","art":{"background":"a1456","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"我从没有想过这些。","art":{"background":"a1456","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"解除诅咒，只要解除诅咒，就万事大吉。","art":{"background":"a1456","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"我满脑子都是这些东西，从未细想过之后的事情。","art":{"background":"a1456","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「现在的我已经能够表达自己的心意了吗……？妈妈……」","art":{"background":"a1457","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"只不过，我已经再也无法见到她了。","art":{"background":"a1457","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……不，我现在依旧无法把表达内心的想法」","art":{"background":"a1455","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"因为刚才我的欣喜就没有传达给他。","art":{"background":"a1455","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"我是那么地感谢有地。","art":{"background":"a1455","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"他却没把我的话放在心上……","art":{"background":"a1455","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……我不甘心……」","art":{"background":"a1456","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"怎样才能让他人知道我现在的心情呢？","art":{"background":"a1456","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"要把自己的欣喜之情化为怎样的话语……才能让对方明白呢？","art":{"background":"a1456","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"我想把我内心的欣喜之情分享给他，哪怕只能传达出一点点也好……但是我做不到。","art":{"background":"a1456","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"这让我又难过……又不甘……","art":{"background":"a1456","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"这种不甘总是让我想起妈妈的音容笑貌。","art":{"background":"a1456","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"我果然……办不到吗……？","art":{"background":"a1456","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……但是，这只是我个人的问题吗？明明人家在严肃地说着自己的真心话，他竟然笑了出来，这也太没礼貌了」","art":{"background":"a1455","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「真是个……没礼貌的人……」","art":{"background":"a1455","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"可话说回来……我好像第一次听到别人这么跟我说。","art":{"background":"a1455","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"不是“可怜”，不是“让人同情”。","art":{"background":"a1455","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"而是“努力了”……这种认同的话语。","art":{"background":"a1455","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"这话太让我惊讶，深深地刺入了我的内心……","art":{"background":"a1455","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「有什么……不管什么都行，只要能传达出那么一丁点」","art":{"background":"a1455","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"说不定就会发生某种改变。","art":{"background":"a1455","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"","text":"我想要传达内心的欣喜……这就是我现在最想做的事情……","art":{"background":"a1455","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a1455","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「喂，茉子」","art":{"background":"a916","sprites":[{"asset":"a848","position":"出","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"『怎么在这时间打电话来，芳乃大人』","art":{"background":"a916","sprites":[{"asset":"a848","position":"出","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a256","position":"85%","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「我有事……想拜托你」","art":{"background":"a916","sprites":[{"asset":"a848","position":"出","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a256","position":"85%","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"『真稀罕啊，还特地打电话过来。到底是什么事呢？』","art":{"background":"a916","sprites":[{"asset":"a848","position":"出","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a284","position":"85%","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-8"}]